n:p002","quote":"武王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m057-0048","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p057","quote":"武王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m030-0048","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p030","quote":"周武王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m003-0055","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p003","quote":"武"}],"identity_note":"依《殷本紀》的特定敘事建立；個別史實及出土材料對應尚未覆核，不按同名跨卷合併。","review":"ai_provisional"},{"id":"cbr-p000188","label":"叔振鐸","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"叔振鐸","mention_ids":["c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0029"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0029","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p017","quote":"叔振鐸"}],"identity_note":"依《周本紀》特定敘事建立；稱號與未見本名不補造，不按同名全庫合併。","review":"ai_provisional"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"叔振鐸","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000188","status":"source_identified","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p017","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-shiji004-022","subject_person_id":"cbr-p000188","predicate":"brother","object_person_id":"cbr-p000150","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p017","quote":"武王弟叔振鐸","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"弟","historicity":"historical_tradition","relative_age":"younger"},"interpretation_note":"僅記本文明示關係，不由繼位推導父子。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p017","text":"其明日，除道，修社及商紂宮。及期，百夫荷罕旗以先驅。武王弟叔振鐸奉陳常車，周公旦把大鉞，畢公把小鉞，以夾武王。散宜生、太顛、閎夭皆執劍以衛武王。既入，立于社南大卒之左，右畢從。毛叔鄭奉明水，衛康叔封布茲，召公奭贊采，師尚父牽牲。尹佚筴祝曰：「殷之末孫季紂，殄廢先王明德，侮蔑神祇不祀，昏暴商邑百姓，其章顯聞于天皇上帝。」於是武王再拜稽首，曰：「膺更大命，革殷，受天明命。」武王又再拜稽首，乃出。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-